        "created_at": "2013-04-21T03:37:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Fleet Limit only applies to Opposition ships. Meaning only the Oppositiion ships add to the Fleet Limit (don't count Strike Force ships), or are affected by the Fleet Limit (Strike Force ships can go where they wnt when they want).</p>",
